219	// Card billing & dunning templates
220	//
221	// Renewals apply wallet credit first, then auto-charge the customer's saved
222	// card for the remainder. When that charge fails we retry on day 1, 3 and 5 and
223	// only suspend once the retries are exhausted. These templates carry that flow.
224	//
225	// They live here rather than in `lib/email-templates.ts` only because this file
226	// is the one owned by the card-billing change; they are built with the same
